title: Rural work
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rural_timer <= 0 and year >= 1924 and rural_strategy
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rural_timer += 14;
card-image: img/MinRural.jpg

= Rural work

The rural demography has historically had a complicated relationship to the <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span>, long timer leader <span class="tooltip-text" title="one of the first Center Marxists, the goat, the legend" style="color: #c10000;">**August Bebel**</span> tried to get the party to adopt an agricultural programme in his time and failed stating this will throw the reconcialitation back by 50 years...

How do we want not to mess up this time?

- @tell_about_programme: Rebuild farmers' trust in our party by pointing out our programme.
- @educate_on_antisemtism: Combat Antisemtism by holding conventions.
- @agitate_class: Build class anger among peasants.
- @nothing_lol: Do nothing...

  
@tell_about_programme
subtitle: (-1 resource)
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rural_trust += 0.5; rural_trust += 0.5 if (editorial_line == "reformist" and socialist_media >= 9); rural_trust += 0.8 if rural_strategy == "Reformism"


@educate_on_antisemtism
subtitle: (-1 resource)
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rural_antisemitism -= 1*(rural_trust*0.4); rural_antisemitism -= 1 if rural_strategy == "Education"

[? if rural_trust < 4: The peasants don't trust us enough to really consider our points. ?][? if rural_trust >= 4: Some peasants consider what we have to say, but we are working against centuries of predjudice. ?]

@agitate_class
subtitle: (-1 resource)
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; peasant_conciousness += 0.5; peasant_conciousness += 0.5 if ideology == "left"; peasant_conciousness += 0.8 if rural_strategy == "Class War"

@nothing_lol



















  
